        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Dyspareunia"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pain with intercourse on approximately 9–10 of 12 attempts, now occurring with most attempts. Superficial and deep pain: sharp burning at the entrance followed by a deeper ache; worse with initial penetration and certain positions. Pain may linger for minutes to hours after sex."
      }
    },
